  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the standby partnership, delivered through expert rosters and managed by Palladium. Support aims to strengthen the international response in South Sudan and includes provision of surge support for WASH Cholera response to World Health Organization - WHO and access expertise support to WFP.</narrative>
  </description>
